        "notes": "Just increasing damage this round.  [Smashing!](item_a7021e28-cb8a-4f39-aeb1-380525b3fea9) is the go-to, but if you're having to hold shield a lot, you could maybe take  [Barrier Reconstruction](item_ecd5cf3c-0293-42e9-b015-0b00c25082f5) instead. Obviously,  [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) is not reccomended against  [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1) but is an absolute must-pick against  [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) \n\nBuy whatever other commons/rares you can afford, but you can jump to the round 4 build if your econ is particularly good",
