        "notes": "This is where the build really starts to come online:  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) gives the last passive heal we need.\nIn total, our passive self healing per second is 2.5% ( [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) ) + 3% ( [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) ) + 5% ( [To Me, My Friends!](item_9bd5bb9d-8026-4092-80c5-21e726c0969f) ) = 10.5%. Unlike lifesteal builds, this happens while stalling and retreating, and can even be used to save teammates.\n\nFrom this round onward, you might find that you're getting as much as (if not more) healing than your supports.",
