        "notes": "[Feeling the Burn](item_256f9e9c-c332-42f2-83d9-ad0d47e23399) isn't particularly powerful since the season 2 patch, but it's okay for adding a little more damage to the hammer swing. If your shield is getting destroyed too quickly,  [Barrier Reconstruction](item_ecd5cf3c-0293-42e9-b015-0b00c25082f5) is reccomended over  [Infusion Generator](item_8aee4021-0d2f-481c-b811-135f2d0fabd8) (since we don't have enough bonus health to justify  [Infusion Generator](item_8aee4021-0d2f-481c-b811-135f2d0fabd8) just yet)\n\nAdding  [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) gives us a lot more firepower, but  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) works too if you want a little more sustain",
