        "notes": "This is the full-power build, if you cant afford it then just add stuff to the round 6 build. I'm saying this because the three perk this round ( [Plan Z](item_8e9dc830-ad05-413a-bcc9-efc0a23d8625) ,  [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) and  [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) ) and our new power  [Infusion Generator](item_8aee4021-0d2f-481c-b811-135f2d0fabd8) ) all have synergy.\n\n [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) 's self-DoT constantly procs  [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) , giving a near-permanent 10% damage reduction.\n\nThose survival perks also increase our max HP, meaning we can start to justify taking [Plan Z](item_8e9dc830-ad05-413a-bcc9-efc0a23d8625) over  [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) and it lets us get much more out of  [Infusion Generator](item_8aee4021-0d2f-481c-b811-135f2d0fabd8) .",
